<div id="tab-currencies-valor-points" style="display: none;">
<h3 class="heading-size-3 first" id="valor-points-for-discipline-priest-healer-pre-raid">Valor Points for Discipline Priest Healer Pre-Raid</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> can be obtained by killing bosses in Raids and completing Heroic Dungeons through the Random Dungeon Finder tool. <br/>
<br/>Valor Point Vendors:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=46556/jamusvaz">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Jamus'Vaz</span></a> (Horde)</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=44245/faldren-tillsdale">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Faldren Tillsdale</span></a> (Alliance)</div></li></ul>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> offers higher item level gear than <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> including an occasional best in slot item. There's a weekly cap of 1600 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, so you need to be a little judicious with your choices - at least early on.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77096/woundlicker-cover">
<img alt="Woundlicker Cover" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_deathwingraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Woundlicker Cover</span></a> is quite a safe early pickup even if it isn't your largest upgrade since you will use it all expansion. After that you can look into grabbing offpieces to keep your tier slots free, like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77089/threadlinked-chain">
<img alt="Threadlinked Chain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_35.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Threadlinked Chain</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77177/splinterfoot-sandals">
<img alt="Splinterfoot Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Splinterfoot Sandals</span></a>. You can also use valor to replace your lower item level slots. Just avoid weak pieces like the two trinket options.<br/>
<br/>
