<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-discipline-priest-healer">Shoulders for Discipline Priest Healer</h4>This is one of our weaker tier slots so we'll grab <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78381/mosswrought-shoulderguards">
