<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-discipline-priest-healer">Back for Discipline Priest Healer</h4>Cloak options are rough so if you're new to the character you might prioritize <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77096/woundlicker-cover">
