<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-discipline-priest-healer">Waist for Discipline Priest Healer</h4>The haste option for Waist is quite a bit lower item level but it's still a great introductory choice (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78398/cord-of-the-slain-champion">
<img alt="Cord of the Slain Champion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_robe_raidmage_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the Slain Champion</span></a>). If you're not able to get any raid gear then the Valor choices are eventual upgrades despite their itemization. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Waist Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=41118/nitro-boosts">
