<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-discipline-priest-healer">Legs for Discipline Priest Healer</h4>Your pants options are quite limited so we'll lock in our tier piece (<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78814/legwraps-of-dying-light">
<img alt="Legwraps of Dying Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidpriest_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of Dying Light</span></a>) early. This is one of our most powerful tier pieces owing to its Haste /<wbr/> Spirit itemization, massive socket count, and generous 30 intellect socket bonus.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54450/powerful-ghostly-spellthread">
