<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-discipline-priest-healer">Main Hand Weapons for Discipline Priest Healer</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78485/maw-of-the-dragonlord">
<img alt="Maw of the Dragonlord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Maw of the Dragonlord</span></a> is your first <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> buy and from a healing perspective you won't take it off unless you get a higher item-level version of the same weapon.<br/>
